    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A living Flash Mob thrall linked to its summoning Blaster.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> the thrall's remaining lifetime, unless its mode changes</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The thrall emits a 60-foot aura granting @UUID[Compendium.astillon-hanaq-adventures-module.astillon-blaster-items.Item.BlasterInspire01]{Inspire} only to its summoning Blaster. No other creature benefits.</p>\n<p>Bonuses from distinct thralls stack. The benefit applies only while Blaster is inside this aura.</p>\n<p>The aura and its linked benefits end if the thrall is destroyed, removed, or expires.</p>",
